{'symbol': 'MS', 'date': '2022-06-22 10:00:00', 'title': 'MORGAN STANLEY AT WORK TO ACQUIRE LEADING NONQUALIFIED DEFERRED COMPENSATION PLAN PROVIDER AMERICAN FINANCIAL SYSTEMS', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MORGAN STANLEY AT WORK TODAY ANNOUNCED THE ACQUISITION OF AMERICAN FINANCIAL SYSTEMS (AFS), A RECOGNIZED LEADER IN PROVIDING NONQUALIFIED EXECUTIVE BENEFIT PLAN SOLUTIONS AND SERVICES TO EMPLOYERS OF ALL SIZES. THE BUSINESS'S FULL-SERVICE DEFERRED COMPENSATION PLAN OFFERINGS INCLUDE: PLAN DESIGN CONSULTING: HELPS ASSESS A SPONSOR'S OBJECTIVES ALONGSIDE RETIREMENT PLAN CONSULTANTS AND FINANCIAL ADVISORS. PLAN IMPLEMENTATION AND ONLINE ENROLLMENT: PROVIDES A SINGLE POIN"}